  triage:deferredNote "Fix: add scripts/smoke/test_report_runtime.py with direct unit coverage of GIT_REVISION validation, the subprocess failure path, tempfile cleanup in finally, and per-caller error_type substitution. Routed to solar's BB3-FIX-R3-1789253000 (fenix, promote_to_branch fix/bb3-qa3-r3, queued behind BB1-FIX-R1)." ;
